<title>USA: Pomeroy names Stephen Pomeroy as CFO.</title>
<headline>Pomeroy names Stephen Pomeroy as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HEBRON, Ky 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pomeroy Computer Resources said Friday its board of directors had promoted Stephen Pomeroy to chief financial officer.</p>
<p>It said Pomeroy will replace Edwin Weinstein, who will remain as an officer.</p>
<p>Pomeroy Computer said the board also named Richard Mills as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Mills was vice president of operations, while Pomeroy was vice president of marketing and corporate development, it said.</p>
<p>Pomeroy Computer provides computer network integration.</p>
</text>
